// docs/proposals/gore_2026-10-05/tools/gen_artery.py, do not hand-edit.
// Attached by game.dll (Sentient::CoopGoreTryArtery) at the entry wound with use_angles, so randvelaxis is in the
// hit BONE's frame. pulse<stage>_<dir><a|b>: stage 1 strong / 2 mid / 3 weak, dir 0..3 = bone-local +Y/-Y/+Z/-Z.
// ONE HEARTBEAT = ONE ANIM CHANGE: game.dll flips a <-> b every beat and the `enter` commands spawn that beat's
// surge - the retail fx recipe (barrel_*_destroyed.tik). Frame-numbered commands did not fire on this
// server-spawned fx entity (2026-10-06 run), so none are used. A beat is five sub-bursts (commanddelay) whose
// speed rises and falls - a rope of blood, not a clump. Strings splat coop_artery_splat where they land.
